    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/76B960DE16E1EABF6B6D63157F84F11F/jobs/19163": {
      "title": "Spanish  Adjunct",
      "description": "Spanish  Adjunct You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Spanish  Adjunct Rockhurst University - Kansas City, MO 64110 Apply Overview Position Type Part Time Education Level Graduate Degree Apply Description The Department of Modern Languages and Literatures at Rockhurst University is looking for Adjunct faculty to teach Spanish language courses during the Fall 2019 semester and beyond. Applicants must have a Master’s degree in Spanish and must be committed to Spanish language teaching using communicative methodologies and technology. The courses that would be offered are scheduled throughout the morning and early afternoon. Rockhurst cannot accept any application materials (resumes, cover letters, etc.) by email, mail, or walk-in. All applications and application materials must be submitted through our online application system. Rockhurst University is an Equal Opportunity Employer and uses E-Verify. Applicants who would enhance the diversity of the University, such as individuals from historically underrepresented groups, are strongly encouraged to apply. Share job details to About ROCKHURST UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
